<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="kicker"><view class="live"></view>FLIGHT LOG ONLINE · 解码你的天空</view>
    <view class="big">每一次起飞</view>
    <view class="big"><text class="g">都值得被</text><text class="c">记住</text></view>
    <view class="verse"><view>登机牌会褪色，</view><view class="vg">飞过的天空不会。</view></view>
    <text class="lede">一分钟，把航班记录变成一本会动的护照。</text>
    <button class="cta" bindtap="shots">上传行程截图 · 开始制作</button>
    <view class="hint">在航旅纵横「行程 → 已结束」里截几张图就行</view>
    <view class="cta2">
      <button class="ghost" bindtap="chooseFile">选择表格</button>
      <button class="ghost" bindtap="manual">手动输入</button>
    </view>
    <view class="links"><text class="lk" bindtap="tryDemo">先看示例</text><text class="ld">·</text><text class="lk" bindtap="playIntro">▶ 20 秒看懂</text><text class="ld">·</text><text class="lk" bindtap="toGuide">三种方式怎么选 ↓</text></view>
    <video wx:if="{{introSrc}}" class="demo" src="{{introSrc}}" autoplay controls object-fit="contain" show-fullscreen-btn bindended="introEnded"></video>
    <view class="more2" bindtap="playDemo">{{showDemo?'收起成片示例 ▴':'看一段生成的成片示例 ▾'}}</view>
    <video wx:if="{{showDemo}}" class="demo" src="{{demoVideo}}" poster="{{demoPoster}}" autoplay controls object-fit="contain" show-fullscreen-btn></video>
  </view>

  <view class="stage">
    <view class="globe">
      <view class="ring"></view><view class="ring r2"></view>
      <image class="gimg" src="{{globeImg}}" mode="aspectFit"/>
      <view class="ghud tl"><view><text class="dot">●</text> 实时航迹</view><view><text class="b">33</text> 条航线</view></view>
      <view class="ghud tr"><view>ORBIT · 01</view><view class="b">29.2°N 110.1°E</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="board">
      <view class="who"><text>示例旅客 · <text class="b">林小舟</text></text><text class="tag">虚构示例</text></view>
      <view class="bstats">
        <view wx:for="{{sample}}" wx:key="l" class="bs"><view class="flaps"><text wx:for="{{item.c}}" wx:for-item="ch" wx:key="index" class="{{ch===','?'sep':'fl'}}">{{ch}}</text></view><text class="bl">{{item.l}}</text></view>
      </view>
      <text class="bnote">这是示例。选择你的表格后，「制作」和「成就」里都会换成你的数据。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="sec" id="guide">
    <view class="sec-h"><text class="code">GUIDE</text>三种方式怎么选</view>
    <view class="way rec" bindtap="shots"><text class="wn">1</text><view class="wb"><view class="wt">上传行程截图<text class="wtag">推荐</text></view><view class="wd">不需要航旅纵横的会员：在航旅纵横「行程 → 已结束」里截图，可以选多张，自动认出每一段航班</view></view><text class="wa">›</text></view>
    <view class="way" bindtap="chooseFile"><text class="wn">2</text><view class="wb"><view class="wt">从聊天中选择表格</view><view class="wd">航旅纵横的会员可以在它的 App 里导出 Excel，发到「文件传输助手」后来这里选</view></view><text class="wa">›</text></view>
    <view class="way" bindtap="manual"><text class="wn">3</text><view class="wb"><view class="wt">手动输入</view><view class="wd">航班不多？一段一段填，机场写中文名或三字码都行</view></view><text class="wa">›</text></view>
    <view class="gsub">方式 2 怎么导出表格（需要航旅纵横会员）：</view>
    <block>
      <view wx:for="{{guide}}" wx:key="index" class="step"><text class="sn">{{index+1}}</text><view class="st"><view>{{item[0]}}</view><view class="small">{{item[1]}}</view></view></view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <text class="foot">本小程序免费，不用注册。表格只在你的手机上解析；生成视频时才把航段发到我们的服务器渲染，24 小时后自动删除。</text>
  <view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="busy">{{busy}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{err}}" class="err">{{err}}</view>
</view>
